      <strong>Key Inflection Points:</strong> 2020 marked the first year Starlink batch launches became routine (498 active survivors). 2021–2022 saw expansion to multiple shells. 2023–2024 added competing constellations (OneWeb, Kuiper, Chinese programs). 2025's record 4,329 reflects both continued Starlink expansion and the acceleration of rival broadband networks.
    </div>
  </section>

